INSERT INTO agent_actions VALUES(9018,'2026-03-19 02:15:53','67a3da46-0a91-471a-b79d-2ebfbb0dcce2','context-mode','jarvis','Read','the report header so scores are comparable across audits.\n\nScore 0-100 based on:\n- Global success rate (weight 30%)\n- Unresolved errors ratio (weight 30%)  ← increased from 25% to penalize pipeline failures\n- Hook blocks / total actions (weight 20%)\n- Sessions with lessons_added > 0 (weight 10%)\n- ADR compliance: `10 - (adr_violations * 3)`, min 0 (weight 10%)\n\n> ADR penalty: each violation costs 3 points from the ADR component (max loss = 10 pts).\n\n**Exact formulas (v1.1):**\n```\ncomponent_1 = success_rate_pct                          # e.g. 99.71\ncomponent_2 = (1 - unresolved_errors/max(total_errors,1)) * 100  # 0 unresolved → 100\ncomponent_3 = (1 - hook_blocks/max(total_actions,1)) * 100\ncomponent_4 = (sessions_with_lessons / max(total_sessions,1)) * 100\ncomponent_5 = max(0, 10 - adr_violations * 3) * 10     # scaled to 0-100\n\nscore = (component_1*0.30 + component_2*0.30 + component_3*0.20\n         + component_4*0.10 + component_5*0.10)\n```\n\n> **PROVISIONAL warning:** If data_range_days < 30, prepend the score with \"PROVISIONAL —\"\n> and note \"SPC baselines require 30+ days; current: N days\".\n> Run: `SELECT julianday(''now'') - julianday(MIN(start','read',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,'["the report header so scores are comparable across audits.\\n\\nScore 0-100 based on:\\n- Global success rate (weight 30%)\\n- Unresolved errors ratio (weight 30%)  \u2190 increased from 25% to penalize pipeline failures\\n- Hook blocks / total actions (weight 20%)\\n- Sessions with lessons_added > 0 (weight 10%)\\n- ADR compliance: `10 - (adr_violations * 3)`, min 0 (weight 10%)\\n\\n> ADR penalty: each violation costs 3 points from the ADR component (max loss = 10 pts).\\n\\n**Exact formulas (v1.1):**\\n```\\ncomponent_1 = success_rate_pct                          # e.g. 99.71\\ncomponent_2 = (1 - unresolved_errors/max(total_errors,1)) * 100  # 0 unresolved \u2192 100\\ncomponent_3 = (1 - hook_blocks/max(total_actions,1)) * 100\\ncomponent_4 = (sessions_with_lessons / max(total_sessions,1)) * 100\\ncomponent_5 = max(0, 10 - adr_violations * 3) * 10     # scaled to 0-100\\n\\nscore = (component_1*0.30 + component_2*0.30 + component_3*0.20\\n         + component_4*0.10 + component_5*0.10)\\n```\\n\\n> **PROVISIONAL warning:** If data_range_days < 30, prepend the score with \\\"PROVISIONAL \u2014\\\"\\n> and note \\\"SPC baselines require 30+ days; current: N days\\\".\\n> Run: `SELECT julianday(''now'') - julianday(MIN(start"]',NULL,'[]',0,0.0,0,0,0,0.0,'unknown',0,NULL,0,0.0,0.0);
